/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
42.5196850393700814 349.5721108346455708 Td
(The main recurring gap is between the deck’s framing and the code-backed implementation. The PPT strongly markets a five-agent,) Tj
T* (continuously integrated, early-detection system, but the code more clearly supports a modular application with LLM-backed features than an) Tj
T* (explicit multi-agent architecture with autonomous handoffs or orchestration. Persistence is lightweight via lowdb JSON, which is pragmatic for an) Tj
T* (MVP but limits claims around scale and continuous multi-source monitoring. LLM handling is useful but fairly basic: plain-text outputs, no) Tj
T* (structured validation, no detected vector-store retrieval, and limited explicit prompt-injection or transparency controls. Privacy/compliance) Tj
T* (implementation is also under-evidenced relative to the problem’s expectations, and direct proof of external procurement/financial/news) Tj
T* (integrations, anomaly detection, and measured predictive outcomes is limited.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 259.8681226771652746 Td
(PPT vs Code Discrepancies) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
42.5196850393700814 244.7084692440943172 Td
(The clearest discrepancy is the “five specialized agents work together” claim on the PPT versus the codebase, which evidences feature-specific) Tj
T* (routes and services rather than visible agent orchestration. Similarly, the deck implies continuous ingestion of financial reports, delivery logs, and) Tj
T* (market/news signals, while available code evidence points more to seeded/local datastore workflows than to real external connectors or) Tj
T* (ingestion pipelines. “Continuous monitoring” is partially supported by WebSocket live updates, but there is no strong evidence of schedulers,) Tj
T* (background jobs, or autonomous monitoring loops. The presentation also suggests stronger anomaly-detection or predictive analytics than the) Tj
T* (retrieved code substantiates; the implementation supports composite scoring, trends, and simulation more convincingly than distinct ML/anomaly) Tj
T* (models.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.067 0.094 0.153 rg
42.5196850393700814 155.0044810866140779 Td
(Innovation Notes) Tj
