/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
42.5196850393700814 139.8448276535431205 Td
(The innovation here is meaningful but pragmatic rather than deeply novel at the systems level. The strongest originality comes from combining) Tj
T* (grounded LLM assistance with procurement workflows users can act on: supplier explanation, risk-to-dollar what-if simulation, admin review, and) Tj
T* (logistics/risk visibility. That creates real operational value. However, the more ambitious innovation claims—multi-agent intelligence, advanced) Tj
T* (anomaly detection, and broad multi-source autonomous monitoring—are not strongly proven in code, so innovation credit is warranted but should) Tj
T* (remain moderate rather than maximal.) Tj
